# Lockup detectors: not enabled yet. A 22.11.2026 build with SOFTLOCKUP_DETECTOR +
# HARDLOCKUP_DETECTOR + DETECT_HUNG_TASK oopsed in hid_add_device (i2c_hid) at boot, because the
# config change altered struct layouts and the modules on the tablet were from the old config
# (no MODVERSIONS). Enable them only together with a module push.
